  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You control water to bear you where you wish to go.</p><p>For <strong>1 minute</strong>, you gain a <strong>Swim</strong> speed of <strong>5</strong>. If you already have a <strong>Swim</strong> speed, it increases by <strong>+5</strong>.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 minutes</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase the <strong>Swim</strong> speed by <strong>+1</strong> per 2 extra successes.</p><p>You can breathe underwater while under the effect of this spell.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.z25T0vW9Eu8GSqK5]{Swim through the Waves}</p>",
